<title>CHINA: Pearl Oriental says to resume trading.</title>
<headline>Pearl Oriental says to resume trading.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxury property developer and hotelier Pearl Oriental Holdings Ltd said on Monday trading in its shares would resume on Tuesday morning.</p>
<p>The company suspended trading in its shares on Monday morning at its own request.</p>
<p>The company's shares gained HK$0.01 to HK$1.17 each on Friday on volume of 44.37 million shares.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6441</p>
</text>
